      <activity id="6cc538db-0d37-5560-9c73-8c2426e7fa97" activityNameId="c94597b6-4f3b-5791-8e17-ed679f6e70f8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Olive pomace, burned in furnace, ash to sanitary landfill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Olive pomace, burned in furnace, ash to sanitary landfill
Air emission from combustion data  completed with ecoinvent inventory of "logs, mixed, burned in wood heater 6kW";
UUID: 11cef752-8711-319c-8e20-f4b9f52eb6ad
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuelinput and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a typical production area for olives in the Lythrodontas region in Cyprus.
Technology: Boiler Furnace
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_11cef752-8711-319c-8e20-f4b9f52eb6ad.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
